# w3 — the modifier chain (mirrors demos/11-noita/w3-modifier-chain.bqn)
# Wand [DP, DP, Triple, SB, SB, SB]: one cast block; both Damage Plus chain through the multicast onto its first bolt.
n 7
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5 6
col wand bool 1 0 0 0 0 0 0
col spell bool 0 1 1 1 1 1 1
col slot num -1 0 1 2 3 4 5
col proj bool 0 0 0 0 1 1 1
col mod bool 0 1 1 0 0 0 0
col multi bool 0 0 0 1 0 0 0
col drawAdd num 0 1 1 3 0 0 0
col damage num 0 0 0 0 3 3 3
col bal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col minBal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col member bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
bind deck mask 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
